    </problem>
    <solution>
      <p>$$y = c_{1}e^{x}\text{cos}\mspace{2mu}\left( {3x} \right) + c_{2}e^{x}\text{sin}\mspace{2mu}\left( {3x} \right) + \frac{2}{5}x + \frac{2}{25}$$</p>
