    <problem>
      <p>$$y^{''} - x^{2} = -3y^{\prime} - \frac{9}{4}y + 3x$$</p>
    </problem>
    <solution>
      <p>$$y = c_{1}e^{(-3\text{/}2)x} + c_{2}xe^{(-3\text{/}2)x} + \frac{4}{9}x^{2} + \frac{4}{27}x - \frac{16}{27}$$</p>
    </solution>
